                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "06da27af-c58f-4b4f-8a64-e75af4b3b212",
                        "source_entry_id": "0ab6f8de-259c-3759-9485-3ad07c55858a",
                        "source_sense_id": "65b2e04a-b724-371d-a778-28015cc65cfb",
                        "target_lang_word": "libertarian",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "libertarian",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "dc9b5cdd-7421-3abe-936c-72980d3b6fea",
                                        "entry_id": "4b5ee7d8-5593-37fd-932c-7e71b8122705",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "One who advocates liberty, either generally or in relation to a specific issue."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "6c3baf06-8aa2-4d47-9c69-0d17050b7757",
                                                "sense_id": "dc9b5cdd-7421-3abe-936c-72980d3b6fea",
                                                "text": "civil libertarian",
                                                "translation": "one who favours civil liberties",
                                                "english": "one who favours civil liberties"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "32c531a8-bf78-42d9-a088-e3d25476fe64",
                                                "sense_id": "dc9b5cdd-7421-3abe-936c-72980d3b6fea",
                                                "text": "cultural libertarian",
                                                "translation": "one who favours cultural freedom",
                                                "english": "one who favours cultural freedom"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "7d792a4d-071e-38a7-93c0-7b2d6a031573",
                                        "entry_id": "4b5ee7d8-5593-37fd-932c-7e71b8122705",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A believer in the freedom of thinking beings to choose their own destiny (the doctrine of free will) as opposed to those who believe the future is predetermined (the doctrine of necessity)."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "aaf6894c-03c6-43ff-aaab-759dcb815fa0",
                                                "sense_id": "7d792a4d-071e-38a7-93c0-7b2d6a031573",
                                                "text": "[W]here is the difference betvveen the Libertarian, vvho ſays that the mind chuſes the motive; and the Neceſſarian, vvho aſſerts that the motive determines the mind; if the volition be the neceſſary reſult of all the previous circumſtances?"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "626e53ff-adf5-3049-90ee-a4359ce786cd",
                                        "entry_id": "4b5ee7d8-5593-37fd-932c-7e71b8122705",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "One who advocates libertarianism (“a political philosophy maintaining that all persons are the absolute owners of their own lives, and should be free to do whatever they wish with their persons or property, provided they allow others that same liberty”); also, a member of a political party supporting libertarianism.",
                                            "An antiauthoritarian believer in left-libertarianism, a political doctrine that stresses both individual freedom and social equality, and advocates shared ownership of natural resources."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "Ireland",
                                            "UK"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "242e5e27-358f-434b-8ffd-5402a3933b1a",
                                                "sense_id": "626e53ff-adf5-3049-90ee-a4359ce786cd",
                                                "text": "[Gustav] Landauer's reorientation of anarchist theory and practice in the direction of idealist and völkisch thought was often incomprehensible to the more traditional libertarians, and in the period of the second Sozialist Landauer no longer felt entirely comfortable with the simple \"anarchist\" label. For Landauer anarchism and socialism had always been different expressions of the same view; now he regarded anarchism as \"merely the negative side of what is positively called socialism.\""
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "2e21778f-b59d-492a-b07f-f7bada0f1484",
                                                "sense_id": "626e53ff-adf5-3049-90ee-a4359ce786cd",
                                                "text": "While anarchism and socialist libertarians have a rich history of revolutionary thinkers ranging from Emma Goldman to George Orwell, the best-known socialist libertarian thinker of today is probably Noam Chomsky."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "2689f045-7d0a-3004-ac1e-892812471a7a",
                                        "entry_id": "4b5ee7d8-5593-37fd-932c-7e71b8122705",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "One who advocates libertarianism (“a political philosophy maintaining that all persons are the absolute owners of their own lives, and should be free to do whatever they wish with their persons or property, provided they allow others that same liberty”); also, a member of a political party supporting libertarianism.",
                                            "A believer in right-libertarianism, a political doctrine that emphasizes individual liberty and a lack of governmental intervention, oversight, and regulation, both in economic matters (that is, a belief in the free market) and in personal behaviour provided that no one's rights are threatened or violated."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "US"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "b457b223-77fa-3eb3-b7c2-a688f050ee4e",
                                        "entry_id": "4b5ee7d8-5593-37fd-932c-7e71b8122705",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "An Araucarian."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "libertarian",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "e496e6c0-ac8c-3973-842c-3b9159a4538c",
                                        "entry_id": "3d5815b5-8c2d-353f-87a5-6db2189e6081",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Advocating liberty; also, having a relative tendency towards liberty."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "7ac18fdc-14d9-4859-835b-8ac64b163eb8",
                                                "sense_id": "e496e6c0-ac8c-3973-842c-3b9159a4538c",
                                                "text": "He has libertarian views."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "c4e38e12-57cc-4d0c-a0fe-6e162c09fb1e",
                                                "sense_id": "e496e6c0-ac8c-3973-842c-3b9159a4538c",
                                                "text": "Libertarian paternalism is the view that, because the way options are presented to citizens affects what they choose, society should present options in a way that \"nudges\" our intuitive selves to make choices that are more consistent with what our more deliberative selves would have chosen if they were in control."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "a170fd51-8ff1-3bbe-aac4-08c3aa4c59cc",
                                        "entry_id": "3d5815b5-8c2d-353f-87a5-6db2189e6081",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Relating to the doctrine of free will as opposed to the doctrine of necessity."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "477c7454-e720-3cf9-8cee-776e1ead1da2",
                                        "entry_id": "3d5815b5-8c2d-353f-87a5-6db2189e6081",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Relating to, or advocating, libertarianism; also, relating to a political party supporting libertarianism."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "5d56f332-1990-4a78-b0cc-2893286ce339",
                                                "sense_id": "477c7454-e720-3cf9-8cee-776e1ead1da2",
                                                "text": "a libertarian capitalist"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "4ea97b1e-9969-49fe-a59e-007e5c5a9a95",
                                                "sense_id": "477c7454-e720-3cf9-8cee-776e1ead1da2",
                                                "text": "For a long time, libertarian was interchangeable in France with anarchist but in recent years, its meaning has become more ambivalent. Some anarchists like David Guérin will call themselves ‘libertarian socialists’, partly to avoid the negative overtones still associated with anarchism, and partly to stress the place of anarchism with the socialist tradition. Even Marxists of the New Left like E[dward] P[almer] Thompson call themselves ‘libertarian’ to distinguish themselves from those authoritarian socialists and communists who believe in revolutionary dictatorship and vanguard parties."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "aad9f0ff-a054-4dad-8a97-3aec2fd544f2",
                                                "sense_id": "477c7454-e720-3cf9-8cee-776e1ead1da2",
                                                "text": "Rand Paul's presidential campaign has drafted in his father, libertarian icon Ron Paul, to directly attack Republican rival Ted Cruz in a robocall in Iowa, the first time the former presidential candidate has gone on the offensive on his son’s behalf."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "bdd68094-e4de-4263-9cab-e5758aee2791",
                                                "sense_id": "477c7454-e720-3cf9-8cee-776e1ead1da2",
                                                "text": "Anonymous activities have over the years leaned incoherently to the libertarian left and right, and everything in between, singling out everyone from Justin Bieber fans to feminists, fascists, cybersecurity specialists, and engaged in the kind of pervert-exposing vigilantism that blue-collar tabloid readers have long been mocked for."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "6e3eb7c0-817c-4043-a8a8-3a27271be965",
                                                "sense_id": "477c7454-e720-3cf9-8cee-776e1ead1da2",
                                                "text": "It was a one-stop political and policy shop, a sort of shadow Republican Party but crafted in the libertarian molds of the Kochs and entirely controlled by them.\nThat wasn’t the only thing that the Koch brothers did differently."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "a1e54de8-70f4-3470-8ebc-d88ee7660e75",
                                        "entry_id": "3d5815b5-8c2d-353f-87a5-6db2189e6081",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Araucarian."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "c358d8dc-491d-4a8b-b75f-6c723b205cb4",
                        "source_entry_id": "0ab6f8de-259c-3759-9485-3ad07c55858a",
                        "source_sense_id": "65b2e04a-b724-371d-a778-28015cc65cfb",
                        "target_lang_word": "libertaire",
                        "target_lang_code": "fr",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "libertaire",
                                "target_lang_code": "fr",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "7105c679-cc05-3a67-a2e8-9df23200d97a",
                                        "entry_id": "c91d021e-3593-356e-8111-d1c1b948a8ba",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Qualifie l’état d’esprit de celui ou de celle qui est très attaché au respect de la liberté absolue."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "152936ef-9782-4ca7-b4c2-c1c7716adca7",
                                                "sense_id": "7105c679-cc05-3a67-a2e8-9df23200d97a",
                                                "text": "Anarchiste juste-milieu, libéral et non LIBERTAIRE, vous voulez le libre échange pour le coton et la chandelle, et vous préconisez des systèmes protecteurs de l’homme contre la femme, dans la circulation des passions humaines"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "39bdb1c2-747e-46a0-9130-f2f1f1747de5",
                                                "sense_id": "7105c679-cc05-3a67-a2e8-9df23200d97a",
                                                "text": "Un conflit ouvrier éclate? Une démonstration politique s’organise? Individualiste effréné — je l’ai dit — presque libertaire, […], le président du Conseil commence par se désintéresser."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "ffc9c954-8225-44a8-9ec1-9f95e6836ade",
                                                "sense_id": "7105c679-cc05-3a67-a2e8-9df23200d97a",
                                                "text": "L’individualisme libertaire, l’insoumission aux nécessités fondamentales d’une société la dissolvent."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "7a0ff905-1aee-4647-93d3-2451d05b7952",
                                                "sense_id": "7105c679-cc05-3a67-a2e8-9df23200d97a",
                                                "text": "Le militant faisait connaissance avec le prolétariat ardennais de la première industrialisation, prompt et quelque peu libertaire, qui put le gêner dans la discussion."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "617d1e6e-8088-34f2-bf1c-200655699811",
                                        "entry_id": "c91d021e-3593-356e-8111-d1c1b948a8ba",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Anarchiste."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "0c2ea971-a93f-4ab9-bb00-c853a6f92f6c",
                                                "sense_id": "617d1e6e-8088-34f2-bf1c-200655699811",
                                                "text": "Toutes les sectes socialistes, qui s’entre-dévoraient, péchaient par l’arbitraire organisation du travail, asservissaient l’individu au profit de la communauté. C’était pourquoi, forcé de concilier les deux grands courants, les droits de la société, les droits de l’individu, il avait fini par mettre toute sa foi dans le communisme libertaire, cette anarchie où il rêvait l’individu délivré, évoluant, s’épanouissant, sans contrainte aucune, pour son bien et pour le bien de tous."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "df99a2d8-b215-4917-a4ae-53baf36dead8",
                                                "sense_id": "617d1e6e-8088-34f2-bf1c-200655699811",
                                                "text": "Vous hantiez les milieux libertaires ; vous prêchiez le chambardement social."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "792c127b-6fe0-372b-9ba8-227a29f962b2",
                                        "entry_id": "c91d021e-3593-356e-8111-d1c1b948a8ba",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Fondé sur les idées libérales ou libre-échangistes."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "Économie",
                                            "Plus rare"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "89f3d0dc-f9d4-41fe-bcea-916f65baa43f",
                                                "sense_id": "792c127b-6fe0-372b-9ba8-227a29f962b2",
                                                "text": "La liberté absolue ne peut exister complètement, elle est incompatible avec l’ordre. Et de fait, elle n’a jamais existé, même sous le régime libertaire."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "6467380e-ae04-3cf3-9e0d-3b68d3532bff",
                                        "entry_id": "c91d021e-3593-356e-8111-d1c1b948a8ba",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Qui refuse l’autorité du maître et la discipline pour laisser à l’enfant la plus grande liberté d’expression et de comportement."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "c30a5449-c0c1-4498-9340-29aec3b80179",
                                                "sense_id": "6467380e-ae04-3cf3-9e0d-3b68d3532bff",
                                                "text": "Les partisans de l’école libertaire partent d’une critique radicale des institutions pédagogiques qu'ils jugent aliénantes. Il s’agit pour eux d’aller plus loin que le « despotisme éclairé » qui caractérise la pédagogie, même dans ses formes les plus libérales (...). L’éducation libertaire n’est pas − contrairement à ce que chacun peut croire − une voie facile et confortable mais une voie angoissante."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "libertaire",
                                "target_lang_code": "fr",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "83b00e2f-28fc-35d7-bf3b-fd7c4815384e",
                                        "entry_id": "eca8bdb6-98c6-3ad4-92cd-d45f2c0ff39c",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Partisan·e de la philosophie libertaire."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "ae67d193-5d74-41eb-8803-fa3b171a0286",
                                                "sense_id": "83b00e2f-28fc-35d7-bf3b-fd7c4815384e",
                                                "text": "Au nom de ce qu’il croit être la justice et une véritable égalité sociale, le libertaire prône une liberté qui fait fi des grands principes d’autorité dans l’organisation sociale ; il refuse les contraintes découlant des institutions fondées sur ce principe."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "8060819f-ae92-4a6f-9bcb-546b45e5aa20",
                                                "sense_id": "83b00e2f-28fc-35d7-bf3b-fd7c4815384e",
                                                "text": "Mon jeune Camarade, tu m’as demandé, non sans quelque intention ironique, de t’expliquer ce qu’est, ou plutôt ce que doit être un libertaire ; te sachant de bonne volonté, quoique avec une tendance atavique à railler ce que tu n’as pas encore compris, je vais tenter de satisfaire ta curiosité."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "93cbc21e-cadb-4458-a55e-7bf0fd6e6af4",
                                                "sense_id": "83b00e2f-28fc-35d7-bf3b-fd7c4815384e",
                                                "text": "Tandis que l’utopie communiste a encore ses praticiens, l’utopie des libertaires n’a pu recevoir le moindre commencement d’exécution."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "ca6f2aa1-b5e7-4280-bb7f-692b9a5d3b58",
